            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>How is the recruitment of brown adipocytes regulated? Ohno et al. (2013) show that the euchromatic histone-lysine N-metyltransferase 1 (EHMT1) is essential for the specification of the brown adipocyte fate, a finding with important implications for the pathophysiology of obesity and obesity-related maladies.</AbstractText>
